# EAS CLI reads this file INSTEAD of .gitignore when archiving the project
# for cloud builds. Keep it identical to .gitignore EXCEPT for the Kokoro
# model block: the 152MB bundled TTS model must ship in EAS builds, so it is
# NOT ignored here. Update both files together.
